{
  "comment": "Import mapping for DrumGizmo's CrocellKit 1.1, the kit of the Danish metal band Crocell. Left/right in piece names are as seen by the drummer (as in the kit's instrument names); stereo mics and pans are from the audience's side, to match the kit stage. The full variant is the kit; the default, small and tiny variants become presets of it.",
